  "releaseNotes": "- Added WorksheetPropertiesExtensions with comprehensive display and formatting options\n      - New methods: SetZoom() for controlling worksheet zoom levels (10-400%)\n      - Added ShowGridlines(), ShowRowColumnHeaders(), ShowZeroValues() for display control\n      - Implemented SetDefaultColumnWidth() and SetDefaultRowHeight() for dimension settings\n      - Added ShowFormulas() to toggle between formula display and results view\n      - New SetRightToLeft() method for right-to-left worksheet display support\n      - All extension methods support fluent method chaining for improved code readability\n      - Enhanced worksheet customization capabilities for better user experience",
